      "description": "Flat card stock label for a hovered brick.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tip\"><p class=\"ds-tip-line\">Build, solid brick</p><p class=\"ds-tip-soft\">Tue 22 Sep</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tip{--paper:#dcd8cf;--panel:#f1eee7;--ink:#232420;--ink-2:#57564f;--hair:rgba(35,36,32,.16);--signal:#f04a00;--wash:rgba(35,36,32,.07);font-family:'Google Sans Flex Variable','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'ROND' 100;display:inline-block;max-width:360px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--hair);border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);font-size:13px;text-align:center}.ds-tip p{margin:0}.ds-tip-line{font-weight:640}.ds-tip-soft{color:var(--ink-2)}"
    },
